  "content": "<div class=\"p-10 font-sans max-w-lg mx-auto bg-stone-950 text-white rounded-3xl border border-yellow-600/30 relative shadow-2xl\">\n  <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-radial-gradient-white pointer-events-none opacity-5\"></div>\n  <div class=\"text-center space-y-6 relative z-10\">\n    <div class=\"text-4xl\">🌟🍾🎆</div>\n    <span class=\"text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] font-mono text-yellow-500 uppercase\">Private Celebration Party</span>\n    <h1 class=\"text-4xl font-black text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-yellow-300 via-amber-100 to-yellow-500 bg-clip-text\">\n       RÉVEILLON VIP\n    </h1>\n    \n    <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 max-w-sm mx-auto leading-relaxed\">\n      Venha brindar a virada do ano com muito estilo, energia positiva e música eletrônica em um evento altamente exclusivo.\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"my-6 border-y border-zinc-800 py-4 grid grid-cols-2 divide-x divide-zinc-800 text-center\">\n      <div>\n        <span class=\"block text-[8px] font-mono text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\">Data Celeste</span>\n        <strong class=\"text-sm text-yellow-400 font-mono\">31 DE DEZEMBRO</strong>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <span class=\"block text-[8px] font-mono text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\">Embarque</span>\n        <strong class=\"text-sm text-yellow-400 font-mono\">às {{hora_inicio}}hs</strong>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bg-zinc-900/50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 text-center space-y-1\">\n      <span class=\"block text-[8px] font-mono text-zinc-500 uppercase\">Local Premium</span>\n      <strong class=\"block text-xs text-yellow-500\">{{local_vip}}</strong>\n      <p class=\"text-[10px] text-zinc-500 font-mono\">{{detalhes_open_bar}}</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pt-6 border-t border-zinc-900 font-mono\">\n      <p class=\"text-[10px] text-zinc-500 uppercase mb-2\">Entrada estritamente com nome na lista</p>\n      <a href=\"https://wa.me/{{whats_rsvp_vip}}\" class=\"inline-block bg-yellow-500 text-black font-extrabold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest py-2.5 px-6 rounded-md shadow-lg transition\">\n        Garantir Acesso VIP / RSVP 🎟️\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
